# FILE: .gitignore
# ROLE: Keeps virtual environments, caches, model files, run data, logs, secrets and OS/editor files out of git.
# ARCH REF: FR-6; D-26; D-38
# OWNS: Ignore rules
# DOES NOT OWN: Line endings (.gitattributes); agent context exclusions (.antigravityignore)
# CONNECTS TO (external boundaries only):
#   - imports from none: none
#   - emits/consumes: none
# INSTRUCTIONS (strict, imperative):
#   1. Implement only this file. If this file's contract with another file must change, stop and report; do not edit the other file.
#   2. Keep every public name and signature declared below exactly as written; they are the contract other files rely on.
#   3. Use only the standard library, the pinned dependencies in pyproject.toml, and the files listed under CONNECTS TO. Ask before adding a dependency.
#   4. Open text files with encoding="utf-8" explicitly.
#   5. Never ignore uv.lock or requirements.lock.txt; they are committed (D-03).
# FORBIDDEN: shell=True; os.system; hardcoded absolute paths; container runtimes; importing project modules not listed under CONNECTS TO; printing secrets or API keys
# ERRORS: Raise a subclass of asf.contracts.errors.AsfError with an actionable message; never swallow exceptions silently.
# DONE WHEN: (1) `uv run python scripts/check_headers.py` reports no problem for this file.

# --- Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.eggs/
# --- virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
# --- tool caches
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.hypothesis/
# --- model files
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.onnx
models/
# --- run data and state
.factory/
runs/
worktrees/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
blobs/
# --- logs and reports
logs/
*.log
doctor-report.*
NOTICE.generated
# --- secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
# --- OS and editor files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
